{
  "id": "1CO.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Cor. 11",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "nb"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Follow my example, as I follow the example of Christ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "On Covering the Head in Worship",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I praise you for remembering me in everything and for holding to the traditions just as I passed them on to you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I want you to realize that the head of every man is Christ, and the head of the woman is man,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and the head of Christ is God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Every man who prays or prophesies with his head covered dishonors his head.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But every woman who prays or prophesies with her head uncovered dishonors her head—it is the same as having her head shaved.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For if a woman does not cover her head, she might as well have her hair cut off; but if it is a disgrace for a woman to have her hair cut off or her head shaved, then she should cover her head.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A man ought not to cover his head,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "since he is the image and glory of God; but woman is the glory of man.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For man did not come from woman, but woman from man;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neither was man created for woman, but woman for man.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is for this reason that a woman ought to have authority over her own",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "head, because of the angels.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless, in the Lord woman is not independent of man, nor is man independent of woman.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For as woman came from man, so also man is born of woman. But everything comes from God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Judge for yourselves: Is it proper for a woman to pray to God with her head uncovered?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Does not the very nature of things teach you that if a man has long hair, it is a disgrace to him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but that if a woman has long hair, it is her glory? For long hair is given to her as a covering.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If anyone wants to be contentious about this, we have no other practice—nor do the churches of God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Correcting an Abuse of the Lord's Supper",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the following directives I have no praise for you, for your meetings do more harm than good.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the first place, I hear that when you come together as a church, there are divisions among you, and to some extent I believe it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No doubt there have to be differences among you to show which of you have God's approval.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So then, when you come together, it is not the Lord's Supper you eat,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for when you are eating, some of you go ahead with your own private suppers. As a result, one person remains hungry and another gets drunk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't you have homes to eat and drink in? Or do you despise the church of God by humiliating those who have nothing? What shall I say to you? Shall I praise you? Certainly not in this matter!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I received from the Lord what I also passed on to you: The Lord Jesus, on the night he was betrayed, took bread,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and when he had given thanks, he broke it and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"This is my body, which is for you; do this in remembrance of me.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CO.11.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CO.11.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the same way, after supper he took the cup, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"This cup is the new covenant in my blood; do this, whenever you drink it, in remembrance of me.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CO.11.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CO.11.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For whenever you eat this bread and drink this cup, you proclaim the Lord's death until he comes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So then, whoever eats the bread or drinks the cup of the Lord in an unworthy manner will be guilty of sinning against the body and blood of the Lord.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Everyone ought to examine themselves before they eat of the bread and drink from the cup.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For those who eat and drink without discerning the body of Christ eat and drink judgment on themselves.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That is why many among you are weak and sick, and a number of you have fallen asleep.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if we were more discerning with regard to ourselves, we would not come under such judgment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless, when we are judged in this way by the Lord, we are being disciplined so that we will not be finally condemned with the world.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So then, my brothers and sisters, when you gather to eat, you should all eat together.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.33",
